---

## Preamble

This License exists to preserve the following principles:

**The Software must be available to everyone on equal terms.
No person may receive less Functionality because they have less money.
The Software and its continuation must remain open.
The Software must be used for genuine human benefit and must not be used to exploit, degrade, or materially harm people.**

These principles are the foundation of this License and shall guide its interpretation.

---

## 1. Definitions

**“Software”** means the software, source code, source materials, documentation, assets, and other materials released by the Copyright Holder under this License.

**“Covered Work”** means the Software and any work that incorporates, modifies, extends, or is substantially derived from the Software.

A Covered Work also includes any software, service, plugin, extension, backend, API, account system, infrastructure, or other component that is intentionally integrated with, distributed with, operated together with, or used to provide the Functionality of a Covered Work, where that component is used to achieve a result that would be prohibited by this License if achieved directly within the Covered Work.

A person must not avoid the requirements of this License by separating a Covered Work into nominally independent components.

**“Licensee”** means any natural person or legal entity exercising rights granted by this License.

**“User”** means any natural person who uses a Covered Work.

**“Functionality”** means any capability, output, result, capacity, quality, performance level, access right, service, feature, or practical benefit provided to a User through a Covered Work, whether provided directly or through another component, service, API, model, infrastructure, or dependency.

**“Commercial Use”** means any use intended to obtain revenue, monetary compensation, commercial advantage, or other economic benefit, whether directly or indirectly.

**“Economic Condition”** means any payment, subscription, purchase, donation, paid account, credit, licence fee, sponsorship, advertising arrangement, or other transfer of money or economic value that is required or used to obtain, retain, improve, accelerate, increase, prioritize, or unlock access to Functionality.

**“Donation”** means a voluntary transfer of money or other value for which the donor receives nothing in return.

A Donation ceases to be a Donation if the donor receives any Functionality, access, capacity, priority, quality, service, status, preference, recognition, advantage, or other consideration in return.

**“Reliable Evidence”** means the overall body of independently verifiable empirical evidence relevant to the matter at issue, including systematic reviews, meta-analyses, multiple independent controlled studies where reasonably applicable, longitudinal evidence, and conclusions supported by established professional or scientific bodies.

A single isolated study, preliminary finding, unreplicated result, anecdotal report, or study of insufficient methodological reliability shall not by itself constitute Reliable Evidence where the broader body of evidence does not support the claimed conclusion.

