The complete source code and source materials necessary to inspect, modify, build, operate, and reproduce the Functionality of a Covered Work must be available without charge under this License.

For a Covered Work operated over a network, the source and other materials necessary to reproduce the network service and its Functionality must likewise be made available without charge under this License to its Users.

No Licensee may require payment, registration fee, subscription, donation, commercial relationship, or other Economic Condition to obtain the source materials required by this Section.

Every Covered Work must be distributed under this License and no other license.

No person may relicense, sublicense, or impose additional terms on a Covered Work that permit conduct prohibited by this License.

A Licensee must not add restrictions that reduce the rights granted by this License.

Independent third-party components that are not Covered Works remain subject to their own licenses where their copyright holders require it.

However, a third-party component must not be used as a means of circumventing any requirement of this License.

